<main id="main">
<div class="mx-auto w-full px-4 md:px-10 desk:max-w-[1180px] desk:px-[clamp(16px,3vw,40px)] [&amp;_:focus-visible]:outline [&amp;_:focus-visible]:outline-2 [&amp;_:focus-visible]:outline-offset-2 [&amp;_:focus-visible]:outline-ink pb-12 pt-5 md:pb-14 md:pt-7 desk:pb-16 desk:pt-10">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-6 desk:grid desk:grid-cols-[minmax(0,260px)_minmax(0,820px)] desk:items-start desk:gap-10">
<nav aria-label="Legal documents" class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
<p class="lbl hidden desk:block">Legal
</p>
<ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 md:grid-cols-4 desk:flex desk:flex-col desk:gap-1.5">
<li class="min-w-0">
<a href="/legal/privacy" class="flex h-full min-h-14 flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 hover:border-ink active:border-ink active:bg-paper desk:px-4 desk:py-3.5">
<span class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink desk:hidden">Privacy
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-display text-[15px] font-bold text-ink desk:inline">Privacy policy
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/70 desk:block">/legal/privacy
</span> 
<span class="self-start rounded-md border border-dashed border-saffron bg-saffron/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink">Not in force yet
</span>
</a>
</li>
<li class="min-w-0">
<a href="/legal/terms" class="flex h-full min-h-14 flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 hover:border-ink active:border-ink active:bg-paper desk:px-4 desk:py-3.5">
<span class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink desk:hidden">Terms
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-display text-[15px] font-bold text-ink desk:inline">Terms of service
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/70 desk:block">/legal/terms
</span> 
<span class="self-start rounded-md border border-dashed border-saffron bg-saffron/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink">Not in force yet
</span>
</a>
</li>
<li class="min-w-0">
<a href="/legal/imprint" class="flex h-full min-h-14 flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border-2 border-ink bg-paper px-3 py-2.5 desk:px-4 desk:py-3.5" aria-current="page">
<span class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink desk:hidden">Company details
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-display text-[15px] font-bold text-ink desk:inline">Company details
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/70 desk:block">/legal/imprint
</span> 
<span class="self-start rounded-md border border-dashed border-saffron bg-saffron/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink">Not in force yet
</span>
</a>
</li>
<li class="min-w-0">
<a href="/legal/cookies" class="flex h-full min-h-14 flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-[14px] border border-line px-3 py-2.5 hover:border-ink active:border-ink active:bg-paper desk:px-4 desk:py-3.5">
<span class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-ink desk:hidden">Cookies
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-display text-[15px] font-bold text-ink desk:inline">Cookies
</span> 
<span class="hidden font-mono text-[11px] text-ink/70 desk:block">/legal/cookies
</span> 
<span class="self-start rounded-md border border-dashed border-saffron bg-saffron/10 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-ink">Not in force yet
</span>
</a>
</li>
</ul>
</nav>
<article class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-7">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5">
<p class="lbl">Legal
<span class="desk:hidden"> · /legal/imprint
</span>
</p>
<h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-none tracking-tight md:text-4xl desk:text-[44px]">Company details
</h1>
<p class="max-w-[620px] text-[15px] leading-normal text-ink md:text-[17px]">Who runs Taptime: the registered company, where it is registered and how to reach it.
</p>
</div>
<section class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[14px] border-2 border-dashed border-saffron bg-saffron-lite px-4 py-4 md:rounded-2xl md:px-6 md:py-[22px]">
<h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight md:text-xl">This text has not been published yet
</h2>
<p class="text-sm leading-normal text-ink">Nothing on this page is in force. It is a placeholder so the document has an address before it has a text, and it will be replaced with the real one — no part of it should be relied on in the meantime.
</p>
<p class="mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Waiting on
</p>
<ol class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<li class="grid grid-cols-[26px_1fr] gap-1.5 text-sm leading-normal text-ink md:grid-cols-[30px_1fr] md:gap-2">
<span class="font-mono font-bold" aria-hidden="true">01
</span> 
<span>Registered company name, legal form and registration number.
</span>
</li>
<li class="grid grid-cols-[26px_1fr] gap-1.5 text-sm leading-normal text-ink md:grid-cols-[30px_1fr] md:gap-2">
<span class="font-mono font-bold" aria-hidden="true">02
</span> 
<span>Registered office address.
</span>
</li>
<li class="grid grid-cols-[26px_1fr] gap-1.5 text-sm leading-normal text-ink md:grid-cols-[30px_1fr] md:gap-2">
<span class="font-mono font-bold" aria-hidden="true">03
</span> 
<span>VAT identification number.
</span>
</li>
<li class="grid grid-cols-[26px_1fr] gap-1.5 text-sm leading-normal text-ink md:grid-cols-[30px_1fr] md:gap-2">
<span class="font-mono font-bold" aria-hidden="true">04
</span> 
<span>A contact email address and, if there is one, a telephone number.
</span>
</li>
<li class="grid grid-cols-[26px_1fr] gap-1.5 text-sm leading-normal text-ink md:grid-cols-[30px_1fr] md:gap-2">
<span class="font-mono font-bold" aria-hidden="true">05
</span> 
<span>The names of the people authorised to represent the company.
</span>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
</article>
